  "details": "With low mouse dpi (in the video I set it to 100) I can do pretty much 180 turns with other players see me staying still. Video: https://youtu.be/I-1zHbs9rTg\nRegardless of in-game mouse sensitivity min or max with low dpi, the player rotates only locally.\nEvolved from this issue https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/horizontal-mouse-movement\n\nThe problem is not appearing while sitting in the chair, so it's related to update which made horizontal rotation faster with low fps:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/drop-low-fps-heavy-iload-in-double-or-more-increase-horizontal-mouse-turning-sen\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/turning-speed-dependent-on-framerate-1\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/turning-accelerated-again\n\n---\nVRChat 2019.3.2p2 - Build 864",
